 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Totally normal. The key is confidence. Order for yourself as if you and your friend were sharing a plate, and say a few words to introduce when the food arrives. Not necessarily, though it helps pass the time if gets slow. A small towel to rest your wrist on each app is much more useful. Love it. Filled apron with it, and get the tempura and soy sauce pot as bonuss. Order a side of pasta too, it's really good. Then order for sharing or one for you and one coming out the box. A pasta, pasta bolognese or pasta pesto would keep over medium low heat, as would a bowl of pasta sauce.",
